{"about_the_game":"<strong>From the writer of \u201cTeleglitch: Die More Edition\u201d comes Shortest Trip to Earth, a roguelike spaceship simulator featuring exploration, ship management, game-influencing decision-making and real-time tactical battles.</strong><br><br>Community Translations available in German, Russian, Simplified Chinese and more<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812040/extras/d0adfd73d1293966e1c13b82bd5d45bc.avif?t=1748431735\" width=640 height=340 /></span><br><i>Onboard combat against hostile intruders is a messy business</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a detailed and deadly universe</h2><br>Embark on a perilous journey through a procedurally generated universe and explore massive space sectors crawling with exotic lifeforms. Engage in action-packed tactical combat against hostile ships, boarding parties and inter-dimensional space monsters. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812040/extras/3a890e3ec1d7cec38715924d7efa366f.poster.avif?t=1748431735\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812040/extras/3a890e3ec1d7cec38715924d7efa366f.webm?t=1748431735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812040/extras/3a890e3ec1d7cec38715924d7efa366f.mp4?t=1748431735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Each ship comes with its own strengths and weaknesses</i><br><br>Master the art of survival by customising your ship with modular components and perks. Choose from a range of spaceships and manage life within your vessel - from crew, pets and drones to ship modules and weapons. Shape your journey through hundreds of multiple-choice events, featuring unique hand-drawn illustrations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812040/extras/95e8f90fd99021480118a752568f821a.avif?t=1748431735\" width=640 height=114 /></span></h2><i>A selection of crew types</i><br><br>Shortest Trip to Earth features unforgiving permadeath, but you can unlock perks to increase the odds of survival on your next run.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master the art of survival in unexplored space!<br></li><li>Explore a procedurally generated universe, packed with content<br></li><li>Collect resources, craft modules &amp; upgrade your ship<br></li><li>Epic real-time tactical space battles <br></li><li>Onboard combat, featuring hostile intruders, drones and battle-hardened pets<br></li><li>500+ ship modules, a variety of ship weapons and nukes <br></li><li>30+ unique crew weapons     <br></li><li>50+ types of crew, drones &amp; combat pets<br></li><li>Hundreds of random events with unique illustrations and outcomes<br></li><li>Every ship starts with a cat</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Rogue Rat blueprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/812040/68c68fdf97d2c22e062126272a1fd5e80cf4a79f.jpg"},{"name":"The Pumpkin Hammer blueprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/812040/0ec0a3169c1faa807e1d8fe309409c90c79b8f72.jpg"},{"name":"The Atlas blueprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/812040/cbdb0bd58896265302cf87900f57084c05facaec.jpg"},{"name":"The Bluestar blueprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/812040/47a48f2500a16aca29e73eead66ab6f134230ae7.jpg"},{"name":"The Warpshell blueprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/812040/e9173372311aa84dea472f13f8cdab0f77b78b38.jpg"},{"name":"The Endurance blueprints","path":